{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48869","headline":"晓歌 · 庄南杰","name":"晓歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鵾鸡哭树星河转，海上金乌翅如电。\n嫦娥敛发绾云头，玉女舒霞织天面。\n九土厨烟满城邑，商洛陇头车马急。\n魏宫钟动绣窗明，梦娥惊对残灯立。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"庄南杰","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_48869.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48869","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}